  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f708de71f40c04bd58581e8cb3286186, type: 3}
  m_Name: Deprem_Soru_01
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::QuestionSO
  soruMetni: "Deprem s\u0131ras\u0131nda kapal\u0131 bir alandaysan ve sars\u0131nt\u0131 ba\u015Flad\u0131ysa ne yapmal\u0131s\u0131n?"
  siklar:
  - "H\u0131zl\u0131ca merdivenlere y\xF6nelmelisin."
  - "Pencerelerin yan\u0131na giderek d\u0131\u015Far\u0131y\u0131 kontrol etmelisin."
  - "\xC7\xF6k-Kapan-Tutun hareketini uygulayarak ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131 ve boynunu korumal\u0131s\u0131n."
  - "Asans\xF6re binerek binadan \xE7\u0131kmal\u0131s\u0131n."
  dogruSikIndex: 2
  aciklama: "Sars\u0131nt\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xC7\xF6k-Kapan-Tutun hareketini uygulayarak ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131 ve boynunu korumal\u0131s\u0131n. Pencerelerden ve devrilebilecek e\u015Fyalardan uzak durmal\u0131s\u0131n."
